  "as_of": "2022-10-25",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would authorise funding from the Consolidated Revenue Fund for parliamentary departments, providing appropriations associated with new measures in the October 2022-23 Budget.",
   "It would allocate money through departmental, administered, asset and liability items, with spending purposes and amounts specified in the bill’s schedule and explained in budget statements.",
   "The appropriations would become available on royal assent, alongside separate government appropriation bills, and the legislation would be repealed from 1 July 2025."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Departmental appropriations could support staff, suppliers, operations and eligible asset expenditure.",
   "Administered appropriations would fund activities contributing to specified departmental outcomes.",
   "Amounts could be credited to special accounts where their purposes matched the relevant appropriation."
  ],
  "affected": "Parliamentary departments receiving the appropriations would be affected.",
